1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 9)

2
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,360
Mr. Zhao.

3
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,639
Are you feeling alright?

4
00:00:28,719 --> 00:00:29,719
Your face is so flushed.

5
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,320
I'm fine.

6
00:00:33,399 --> 00:00:34,399
Glad to hear it.

7
00:00:35,039 --> 00:00:36,039
Let's go.

8
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,039
Zhao Shengge...

9
00:00:42,119 --> 00:00:43,280
carries my scent on him.

10
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,760
Shen Zongnian,

11
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,840
when are you going to
get a Christmas tree for me?

12
00:00:49,439 --> 00:00:50,439
Don't know how.

13
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,359
Zhao Shengge has all the luck,

14
00:00:53,439 --> 00:00:55,280
having someone get a
Christmas tree for him.

15
00:00:57,359 --> 00:00:58,679
Hey, Shengge.

16
00:00:58,759 --> 00:01:00,200
You got this car modded, right?

17
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,399
What's the top speed?

18
00:01:01,479 --> 00:01:02,800
Hard to say.

19
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,279
The faster it goes,

20
00:01:04,359 --> 00:01:05,439
and the higher the chassis,

21
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:08,319
the more trash cans you can knock over.

22
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:09,560
Come on!

23
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,040
I...

24
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:12,200
I only hit a trash can that one time!

25
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,280
Catch.

26
00:01:14,439 --> 00:01:15,439
Thanks, boss!

27
00:01:15,519 --> 00:01:16,799
Drive safe.

28
00:01:16,879 --> 00:01:17,799
Shen Zongnian,

29
00:01:17,879 --> 00:01:18,999
did I hear that right?

30
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,959
Zhao Shengge actually cares about me!

31
00:01:25,599 --> 00:01:26,775
Wait, if you give him your car,

32
00:01:26,799 --> 00:01:27,799
how are you getting back?

33
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:30,079
Mr. Zhao, if you don't mind,

34
00:01:30,159 --> 00:01:31,480
you can ride back with me.

35
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:33,480
If it's any trouble,

36
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:34,656
I can always catch a ride with Jiang Ying.

37
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:35,760
It's no trouble at all.

38
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,560
Right this way.

39
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,480
Shen Zongnian, hurry and get in!

40
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:41,560
Zongnian,

41
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:42,775
with you keeping an eye on him,

42
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:43,799
he'll be fine.

43
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,295
Mr. Zhao, why don't you take the back?

44
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:55,319
There's more legroom.

45
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,280
I'll take the passenger seat.

46
00:01:58,359 --> 00:01:59,359
The view is better.

47
00:01:59,879 --> 00:02:00,879
Alright.

48
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:15,039
Mr. Zhao,

49
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,080
let me get that for you.

50
00:02:58,800 --> 00:02:59,800
Chen Wan,

51
00:03:01,879 --> 00:03:03,599
where should I put this lipstick of yours?

52
00:03:04,599 --> 00:03:05,599
It's my mom's.

53
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,880
Chen Wan,

54
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,240
I asked where to put it.

55
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:13,040
I'm sorry.

56
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,120
I misheard you.

57
00:03:14,759 --> 00:03:16,960
You can just put it in the glove box.

58
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,559
Mr. Zhao,

59
00:03:27,639 --> 00:03:29,799
feel free to change the
radio station right here.

60
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:30,240
Okay.

61
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:32,079
Up to you.

62
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:33,159
By the way, Chen Wan,

63
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:36,639
can I run something by you?

64
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:38,840
What is it?

65
00:03:40,639 --> 00:03:42,000
I rarely get days off.

66
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,280
When you keep calling me that,

67
00:03:43,319 --> 00:03:45,119
it makes me feel like
I'm still on the clock.

68
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:48,639
Then what should I call you?

69
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:50,880
If you don't mind,

70
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,399
just call me by my name.

71
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:53,879
Let's drop the formalities.

72
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:55,200
Youming,

73
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,119
and Zongnian,

74
00:03:56,199 --> 00:03:57,280
that's what they call me.

75
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,080
Okay.

76
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:05,280
Sure.

77
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,679
Let's go.

78
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:07,759
Got it,

79
00:04:08,319 --> 00:04:08,920
Zhao.

80
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:09,559
Sheng-

81
00:04:09,639 --> 00:04:10,639
ge.

82
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,600
The AC.

83
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:46,960
Mr. Zhao, sit here.

84
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,040
It's out of the draft.

85
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:54,600
Shengge,

86
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,000
living like a king today, huh?

87
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,136
Everyone, see if there's
anything you want to add.

88
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,920
We don't come to this
restaurant very often.

89
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:07,319
Wan,

90
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:08,399
you order for us.

91
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:13,920
Mr. Zhao,

92
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:14,879
take a look at the menu

93
00:05:14,959 --> 00:05:16,399
and see what you're in the mood for.

94
00:05:16,879 --> 00:05:18,199
Address me properly,

95
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,279
or I won't answer.

96
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,776
There are too many people
around. It's not appropriate.

97
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,800
Next time.

98
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:25,199
Names are meant to be used.

99
00:05:26,639 --> 00:05:28,800
Well, you have to give me
some time to get used to it.

100
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,040
OK.

101
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:32,759
Hey!

102
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:34,759
Are you two ever going to order?

103
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:37,319
I'm exhausted and I've
been starving all day!

104
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,480
You can order on your phone, too.

105
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,960
Just scan it and look for yourself.

106
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,319
Nian,

107
00:05:42,399 --> 00:05:42,999
stop working.

108
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:44,439
Hand me your phone so I can order.

109
00:05:47,199 --> 00:05:48,599
Steamed fish with black bean sauce,

110
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:50,799
and an order of steamed rice cakes.

111
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:51,999
The steamed rice cakes...

112
00:05:52,079 --> 00:05:53,696
Would you still like to
keep that on the order?

113
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,720
Yes.

114
00:05:55,319 --> 00:05:57,360
I just never realized I liked them before.

115
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:02,119
Do you prefer them sweeter or milder?

116
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:04,119
With osmanthus?

117
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:05,400
Let's try both.

118
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,480
Sure.

119
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:18,999
Shengge,

120
00:06:19,079 --> 00:06:20,976
things have been pretty
rough on Ting Island lately.

121
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,000
I'm thinking,

122
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,935
for the Lychee Bowl Phase Two project,

123
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:25,199
maybe we should put it on hold?

124
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,600
That's not how I see it.

125
00:06:27,399 --> 00:06:28,799
If we delay the site inspection,

126
00:06:28,879 --> 00:06:30,600
a massive amount of cash flow gets tied up,

127
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,799
multiplying the leverage.

128
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:33,879
The risk is too high.

129
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,360
Then you'd better bring extra men.

130
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,319
After Mak Ka Fai went down,

131
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:39,976
Li Jiaming took some
of his crew back there.

132
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:42,759
Word is, Li Jiaming's old
turf was right in Lychee Bowl.

133
00:06:43,639 --> 00:06:44,839
I know what I'm doing.

134
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:46,519
But...

135
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:51,879
Alright, drop it.

136
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:52,959
Let's eat.

137
00:06:53,839 --> 00:06:54,600
Shengge,

138
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,999
bring more backup when you go.

139
00:06:56,079 --> 00:06:57,079
Watch your back.

140
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,240
What was that for?

141
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:10,720
It's fine. Go ahead.

142
00:07:11,759 --> 00:07:12,879
I want to go to Ting Island.

143
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:16,280
Looking for a getaway?

144
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,600
We can all

145
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,160
take a trip to Feiling Island later.

146
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,519
I'll be back before you know it.

147
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,295
We'll call it a team-building retreat.

148
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:24,319
No,

149
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,360
I'm not going for fun.

150
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:28,240
I want to go to Ting Island with you.

151
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,319
Why?

152
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:31,319
I need to calculate the
tidal energy conversion

153
00:07:31,399 --> 00:07:33,239
and finalize the transfer
equation parameters.

154
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:34,495
Dr. Fang has plenty of students

155
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:35,840
who can run those tests.

156
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,680
True, but our
specializations are different.

157
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:40,240
Otherwise, you wouldn't be
paying two separate teams, Mr. Zhao.

158
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,720
I can pay my own way.

159
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:48,439
Chen Wan.

160
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:49,519
Zhao Shengge,

161
00:07:52,279 --> 00:07:53,960
I'd be worried sick.

162
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,040
I want to go.

163
00:08:02,879 --> 00:08:04,960
Though if I'll really just be in the way...

164
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,200
Do you know how to use a gun?

165
00:08:07,439 --> 00:08:08,439
I do.

166
00:08:10,319 --> 00:08:11,999
Once we're there, you do everything I say.

167
00:08:13,199 --> 00:08:14,199
Every word.

168
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,360
Eat your food.

169
00:08:20,519 --> 00:08:21,080
What are you two

170
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,280
whispering about over there?

171
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:28,160
Waiter,

172
00:08:33,759 --> 00:08:34,919
could I get a new spoon?

173
00:08:35,639 --> 00:08:37,559
This one seems a little bent.

174
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,320
Right away, sir.

175
00:08:56,679 --> 00:08:57,679
Second Boss,

176
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,760
that traitor Li Jiaming—

177
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,320
he's joined forces with Zhao Shengge.

178
00:09:02,279 --> 00:09:03,199
My informant says.

179
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:04,456
Zhao Shengge is heading to Ting Island

180
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:06,040
to survey the data at Lychee Bowl.

181
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,760
A scientific survey? Please.

182
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,519
It's just a cover to meet up with him.

183
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:12,319
If they team up,

184
00:09:12,399 --> 00:09:13,479
what are we supposed to do?

185
00:09:14,879 --> 00:09:16,080
This might just be

186
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,799
the break we need.

187
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:19,879
A break?

188
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:26,760
I know Zhao Shengge is
the crown prince of Haishi,

189
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,240
but nobody ever said

190
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,960
he runs things on Ting Island.

191
00:09:33,279 --> 00:09:34,679
Brilliant as always, Second Boss—.

192
00:09:36,919 --> 00:09:38,200
I mean, Boss!

193
00:09:47,879 --> 00:09:48,360
Thank you.

194
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,360
My pleasure.

195
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,479
Give it a try. How is it?

196
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:51,559
Okay.

197
00:09:56,559 --> 00:09:57,760
Not bad.

198
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:00,240
Though I usually take
mine a notch less sweet.

199
00:10:00,759 --> 00:10:01,959
Viola, make a note of that.

200
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:03,360
Keep Lucas in the loop, too.

201
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,440
What?

202
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,679
You'll be coming to
Minglong a lot in the future.

203
00:10:10,759 --> 00:10:11,759
Thank you.

204
00:10:13,919 --> 00:10:14,919
What about food?

205
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:18,240
What do you usually like to eat?

206
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:21,240
I prefer Cantonese cuisine.

207
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,599
Though my mother is from Gusu.

208
00:10:23,679 --> 00:10:25,360
So I'm also used to Jiangzhe flavors.

209
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,840
Then what about you, Zhao Shengge?

210
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:30,120
What kind of food do you like?

211
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,600
Don't you already know?

212
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,440
I don't.

213
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,440
I like home-cooked meals.

214
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:42,319
Just the most ordinary kind.

215
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:43,160
Okay.

216
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,320
I'll keep that in mind too.

217
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,000
Chen Wan.

218
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:09,599
Take this.

219
00:11:09,679 --> 00:11:10,679
For me?

220
00:11:12,399 --> 00:11:13,959
You know how to use a gun, right?

221
00:11:14,039 --> 00:11:16,039
I saw your shooting
stance. Your form is solid.

222
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,400
I rarely practice.

223
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,840
Don't get many chances to use one.

224
00:11:20,519 --> 00:11:21,439
If it comes down to it,

225
00:11:21,519 --> 00:11:22,519
just shoot.

226
00:11:24,159 --> 00:11:25,400
Thank you, Zhao Shengge.

227
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:27,040
Later, when you have some free time,

228
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,920
I'll have someone come measure your grip

229
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,120
and custom-make one for you.

230
00:11:32,679 --> 00:11:33,479
In the future,

231
00:11:33,559 --> 00:11:35,319
you'll likely be
traveling far for business,

232
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:36,919
especially overseas.

233
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,760
Having a gun that fits your hand

234
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,840
is vital.

235
00:11:44,799 --> 00:11:45,799
No need.

236
00:11:46,679 --> 00:11:48,119
This one is more than enough for me.

237
00:11:49,159 --> 00:11:50,159
You have a good eye.

238
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,320
Dr. Fang.

239
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,639
You guys are here so early.

240
00:12:01,279 --> 00:12:02,439
Sorry about that, Miss Xu.

241
00:12:02,519 --> 00:12:03,519
Kept you waiting so long.

242
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:06,319
Chen Wan.

243
00:12:06,399 --> 00:12:07,456
This is the latest engineering blueprint

244
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:09,679
I pulled an all-nighter to finish.

245
00:12:09,759 --> 00:12:10,759
Here, take a look.

246
00:12:11,559 --> 00:12:12,559
Okay, let me see.

247
00:12:13,639 --> 00:12:14,976
How are the arrangements coming along?

248
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:15,640
Look.

249
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:17,479
This is our current layout plan.

250
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:18,360
Yes.

251
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,640
That's right.

252
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:20,720
Dr. Fang,

253
00:12:20,799 --> 00:12:22,120
send a copy to my phone.

254
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,520
We can discuss it over the phone.

255
00:12:23,919 --> 00:12:24,959
Here, hold this.

256
00:12:25,039 --> 00:12:25,520
Watch out for the sun.

257
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:27,000
Sure.

258
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:29,559
The research vessel crew
has been strictly vetted.

259
00:12:29,639 --> 00:12:30,639
The bodyguards too.

260
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:36,760
Excuse me.

261
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:37,679
He's with us.

262
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:38,759
Go on.

263
00:12:39,279 --> 00:12:40,615
The bodyguards will also follow in a yacht,

264
00:12:40,639 --> 00:12:41,639
staying ten meters away

265
00:12:41,679 --> 00:12:43,439
so they don't disrupt
everyone's daily work.

266
00:12:43,519 --> 00:12:45,240
Good. Get back to your work.

267
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,679
Okay, I'll go get ready.

268
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,840
Mr. Zhao.

269
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,439
Miss Xu.

270
00:12:55,519 --> 00:12:56,920
I'll leave you two to talk.

271
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,000
No need.

272
00:12:58,679 --> 00:12:59,679
Go ahead.

273
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,240
Aren't you afraid of Li Jiaming?

274
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,079
Lai Chi Wun is his turf.

275
00:13:04,159 --> 00:13:06,799
You swooped in and took
his cash cow of over a decade,

276
00:13:06,879 --> 00:13:08,495
and now you're walking right into his den?

277
00:13:08,519 --> 00:13:10,079
Money talks.

278
00:13:10,159 --> 00:13:13,279
Especially to an old syndicate
enforcer who's been around the block.

279
00:13:14,279 --> 00:13:15,279
Just with this?

280
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:16,920
The enemy of my enemy

281
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,479
can be a friend.

282
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:20,000
You want to back Li Jiaming

283
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,855
and watch the White Crane
Syndicate tear itself apart?

284
00:13:21,879 --> 00:13:23,880
That depends on the choice he makes.

285
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:25,176
Which wife's son does he favor the most?

286
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,760
His sons are all in Haishi.

287
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:28,679
He also secretly runs a private bank

288
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:29,759
on the black market.

289
00:13:29,799 --> 00:13:31,399
Taking him down won't be hard.

290
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:34,559
A private bank?

291
00:13:34,639 --> 00:13:35,520
Then I

292
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,920
can pitch in a little.

293
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,319
Much appreciated.

294
00:13:38,399 --> 00:13:39,199
Don't mention it.

295
00:13:39,279 --> 00:13:40,559
We're partners, after all.

296
00:13:40,639 --> 00:13:41,120
Safe travels.

297
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,200
Thanks.

298
00:14:05,399 --> 00:14:06,855
This humble place is a bit
rough around the edges.

299
00:14:06,879 --> 00:14:08,920
Nothing like the mansions you're used to.

300
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,000
Hope you don't mind.

301
00:14:10,039 --> 00:14:11,559
You're too modest, Boss Li.

302
00:14:11,639 --> 00:14:12,639
Come.

303
00:14:13,159 --> 00:14:14,040
Gentlemen,

304
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:16,719
our boss has arranged
accommodations for everyone.

305
00:14:16,799 --> 00:14:17,799
Please follow us.

306
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:20,640
Mr. Zhao,

307
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,479
in the tearoom,

308
00:14:21,559 --> 00:14:23,255
I have some rare tea you
won't find anywhere else.

309
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:24,079
Let's go have a taste.

310
00:14:24,159 --> 00:14:26,240
Sir, please follow me to your room to rest.

311
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,600
Zhao Shengge.

312
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:32,920
You head back first.

313
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,000
It's fine.

314
00:14:34,679 --> 00:14:35,280
Sir.

315
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,360
This way.

316
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,240
Please.

317
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,600
Come.

318
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,079
Mr. Zhao,

319
00:14:49,159 --> 00:14:51,719
I heard your terms loud and clear,

320
00:14:51,799 --> 00:14:54,679
but you're asking for too much.

321
00:14:57,039 --> 00:14:58,640
After Mak Ka Fai goes down,

322
00:14:58,720 --> 00:15:02,240
you should know very well how much I take.

323
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,240
So you're haggling with me?

324
00:15:06,679 --> 00:15:08,039
I wouldn't dare.

325
00:15:21,039 --> 00:15:22,160
Mr. Zhao,

326
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:24,000
you brought quite a crowd this time.

327
00:15:24,759 --> 00:15:25,840
Standard security.

328
00:15:26,759 --> 00:15:28,040
Mr. Chen

329
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,416
has been standing right over there.

330
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:31,040
Ever since you walked in,

331
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:32,839
he's been right there.

332
00:15:32,919 --> 00:15:34,639
Hasn't strayed a single step.

333
00:15:36,759 --> 00:15:37,759
Seems like

334
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,559
the people around you

335
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:43,200
care about you a great deal.

336
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,599
Don't joke around.

337
00:15:54,679 --> 00:15:55,520
Mr. Zhao,

338
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:57,319
the terms you just mentioned,

339
00:15:57,399 --> 00:15:58,880
I can agree to them.

340
00:15:58,960 --> 00:15:59,599
However,

341
00:15:59,679 --> 00:16:01,240
I have terms of my own.

342
00:16:01,320 --> 00:16:02,679
That project in Lai Chi Wun,

343
00:16:02,759 --> 00:16:04,319
leave me a piece of the pie.

344
00:16:04,399 --> 00:16:07,919
Just enough for my boys to make a living.

345
00:16:19,919 --> 00:16:20,919
Thank you, thank you.

346
00:16:26,159 --> 00:16:27,159
Please.

347
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,240
Mr. Chen.

348
00:16:33,879 --> 00:16:34,879
Mr. Chen,

349
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:37,880
are you waiting for Mr. Zhao here?

350
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:39,000
No.

351
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:39,799
I just came to admire

352
00:16:39,879 --> 00:16:41,960
and take a tour of your backyard, Mr. Li.

353
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:44,439
Mr. Chen,

354
00:16:44,519 --> 00:16:47,520
you looked familiar when I saw you at noon.

355
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:49,399
Have we met before?

356
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,400
If you go to Haishi often, Mr. Li,

357
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:56,000
it's only natural we've crossed paths.

358
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:58,000
Let's head back inside.

359
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,280
The sun's too strong out here.

360
00:17:00,639 --> 00:17:01,639
Okay.

361
00:17:03,159 --> 00:17:04,159
Mr. Zhao,

362
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:05,479
what's the plan for tomorrow?

363
00:17:05,559 --> 00:17:07,719
We're heading out to sea
tomorrow for seabed testing.

364
00:17:07,799 --> 00:17:09,840
However, our research
vessel isn't in position yet.

365
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,295
I might have to trouble
you to make arrangements.

366
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:11,920
Don't worry.

367
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:14,255
I'll have everything set up
for you first thing tomorrow.

368
00:17:14,279 --> 00:17:15,199
We'll take our leave then.

369
00:17:15,279 --> 00:17:16,279
Thank you.

370
00:17:19,279 --> 00:17:19,999
Mr. Zhao,

371
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:21,160
did the talks go well?

372
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,999
Are the seabed test results in?

373
00:17:23,079 --> 00:17:24,759
We're still sorting through the data.

374
00:17:24,839 --> 00:17:26,679
I'll have it compiled by tonight.

375
00:17:26,759 --> 00:17:28,320
Based on the actual findings,

376
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:30,360
the geological conditions in these waters

377
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:31,440
are ideal.

378
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,199
If we cut through

379
00:17:33,279 --> 00:17:34,759
an undersea ridge right here,

380
00:17:34,839 --> 00:17:37,120
we can open up a viable channel.

381
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,240
Thanks for your hard work.

382
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,136
Once our research vessel is in position,

383
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,936
we'll move on to the next
phase of detailed surveying.

384
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:43,080
Okay.

385
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,320
What kind of research vessel?

386
00:18:14,559 --> 00:18:18,440
Sorry, the number you have
dialed is temporarily unavailable.

387
00:18:49,319 --> 00:18:50,319
Where are you going?

388
00:18:55,759 --> 00:18:56,759
Chen Wan.

389
00:18:57,319 --> 00:18:58,759
Leaving right after sneaking a peek?

390
00:19:04,119 --> 00:19:04,679
Zhao Shengge,

391
00:19:04,759 --> 00:19:05,840
you're such a fast swimmer.

392
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:06,920
You saw?

393
00:19:09,319 --> 00:19:10,959
What brings you out for a swim, Mr. Zhao?

394
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:14,160
He sent two people to my room.

395
00:19:16,119 --> 00:19:17,119
Chen Wan,

396
00:19:17,759 --> 00:19:18,759
time me.

397
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:43,200
Swimmer number six, Zhao
Shengge, gets off to a smooth start.

398
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:45,880
Final sprint!

399
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:47,080
One minute, five seconds.

400
00:19:47,160 --> 00:19:47,959
Go, go, go!

401
00:19:48,039 --> 00:19:49,759
A new record!

402
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:58,000
Good luck on your competition.

403
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:07,240
What's my time?

404
00:20:09,119 --> 00:20:10,400
One minute, five seconds.

405
00:20:11,799 --> 00:20:13,080
Chen Wan.

406
00:20:13,160 --> 00:20:14,656
You didn't even start the timer, did you?

407
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:15,840
You weren't paying attention.

408
00:20:16,799 --> 00:20:17,920
I was watching closely.

409
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:19,640
Then why didn't you time me?

410
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:21,400
Because I was too focused on watching you,

411
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:22,759
I forgot to hit the button.

412
00:20:23,799 --> 00:20:25,439
Do you want to keep swimming?

413
00:20:25,519 --> 00:20:26,800
Do two more laps.

414
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:29,039
I promise I'll time it properly this time.

415
00:20:29,119 --> 00:20:30,119
You want to watch?

416
00:20:32,279 --> 00:20:32,959
I'm done swimming.

417
00:20:33,039 --> 00:20:34,039
Next time.

418
00:20:35,279 --> 00:20:36,279
Is there any water?

419
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:39,640
Is coconut water okay?

420
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:40,720
Sure.

421
00:21:44,039 --> 00:21:45,039
What is it?

422
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:51,160
With that pose, it looks
like you're proposing.

423
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:55,800
Let's go to Feiling Island
together when we get back.

424
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:58,720
You're actually going for team-building?

425
00:21:59,279 --> 00:22:00,439
You don't want to go with me?

426
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:01,439
Alone?

427
00:22:01,519 --> 00:22:02,360
No, that's not it.

428
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:03,440
I want to go.

429
00:22:05,680 --> 00:22:06,680
I'm done.

430
00:22:40,799 --> 00:22:41,799
Put this on?

431
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:43,880
Okay.

432
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,000
Let's go.

433
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:16,560
If we cut through

434
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:17,759
the ocean ridge right here,

435
00:23:17,839 --> 00:23:21,319
we can bypass these fault lines.

436
00:23:22,480 --> 00:23:23,800
Any other options?

437
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:25,039
We could also

438
00:23:25,119 --> 00:23:26,999
fill in this trench,

439
00:23:27,079 --> 00:23:29,359
but that'll push back the
timeline and drive up costs.

440
00:23:31,559 --> 00:23:32,800
Let me think it over.

441
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:33,519
I'll head out then.

442
00:23:33,599 --> 00:23:34,639
Thanks for your hard work.

443
00:23:44,680 --> 00:23:45,680
Chen Wan.

444
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:58,920
Watch out!

445
00:24:00,279 --> 00:24:01,679
Don't worry.

446
00:24:01,759 --> 00:24:03,239
I won't leave your side for a second.

447
00:24:21,839 --> 00:24:22,839
Chen Wan.

448
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:24,800
Go get some rest.

449
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:25,320
No need.

450
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:26,400
I'm not tired.

451
00:24:28,680 --> 00:24:30,160
What were you trying to do yesterday?

452
00:24:32,519 --> 00:24:33,840
Yesterday afternoon,

453
00:24:33,920 --> 00:24:34,920
outside the tearoom.

454
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:39,880
I just wanted to take a walk
in the garden to clear my head.

455
00:24:40,880 --> 00:24:41,880
Is that so?

456
00:24:45,839 --> 00:24:46,839
Chen Wan.

457
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:49,200
Can you keep yourself safe?

458
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:53,920
I can.

459
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:07,600
Mr. Zhao, Mr. Chen.

460
00:25:07,680 --> 00:25:09,400
We've wrapped up today's schedule,

461
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:11,120
and we're getting ready to head back.

462
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:11,999
Good work.

463
00:25:12,079 --> 00:25:13,199
My pleasure, Mr. Zhao.

464
00:25:13,279 --> 00:25:14,759
I'm Boss Li's deputy.

465
00:25:14,839 --> 00:25:16,119
Just call me Lin Lian.

466
00:25:16,720 --> 00:25:17,160
Hello.

467
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:19,479
Does anyone need anything from us?

468
00:25:19,559 --> 00:25:20,439
Dr. Fang,

469
00:25:20,519 --> 00:25:22,095
is there anything else
you need on your end?

470
00:25:22,119 --> 00:25:23,600
I've already looked into.

471
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:25,519
Li Jiaming's deputies.

472
00:25:25,599 --> 00:25:26,439
Very impressive.

473
00:25:26,519 --> 00:25:27,519
Everything looks solid.

474
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:29,320
This really is

475
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:32,279
the most advanced
research vessel I've ever seen.

476
00:25:32,359 --> 00:25:33,376
I'll leave you to your work, then.

477
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:34,719
We'll stay out of your hair.

478
00:25:34,799 --> 00:25:35,799
Alright.

479
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:37,680
Chen Wan.

480
00:25:38,279 --> 00:25:39,320
Come take a look at this.

481
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:40,279
If our pipeline

482
00:25:40,359 --> 00:25:42,160
has to pass through this sector,

483
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:44,480
do you think we need to
displace the surface mudstone?

484
00:25:46,039 --> 00:25:48,880
The easiest way is obviously
backfilling with gravel,

485
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:50,535
but that creates too
much acoustic interference.

486
00:25:50,559 --> 00:25:52,000
It might mess with the sonar.

487
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:54,000
OK.

488
00:25:59,799 --> 00:26:01,880
I hope I'm just overthinking it.

489
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:08,880
Captain!

490
00:26:08,960 --> 00:26:09,960
What do we do?

491
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:13,560
Unidentified vessels approaching!

492
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:14,960
All hands on high alert! Move it!

493
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:33,920
You...

494
00:26:34,000 --> 00:26:35,000
Stay back!

495
00:26:35,039 --> 00:26:36,039
Stay back!

496
00:26:42,759 --> 00:26:44,440
Finally found it.

497
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:47,880
Get to the bridge!

498
00:26:47,960 --> 00:26:49,200
Get Dr. Fang to the escape pod!

499
00:26:49,759 --> 00:26:50,320
The control room!

500
00:26:50,400 --> 00:26:51,080
How many of them infiltrated the ship?

501
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,479
Run!

502
00:26:52,559 --> 00:26:53,879
I'm taking you to the escape pod.

503
00:27:09,039 --> 00:27:10,039
Let's go.

504
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:15,679
Get down!

505
00:27:15,759 --> 00:27:16,080
Get down!

506
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:17,400
Get down!

507
00:27:17,480 --> 00:27:18,480
Down!

508
00:27:19,640 --> 00:27:21,055
There are only two
escape pods on this ship.

509
00:27:21,079 --> 00:27:23,120
One was used for
Dr. Fang. There's one left.

510
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:25,520
If anything goes south, I'll
back you up from the outside.

511
00:27:26,039 --> 00:27:26,920
- Zhao Shengge.
- Chen Wan.

512
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:28,000
Get in.

513
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:30,400
Listen to me.

514
00:27:31,559 --> 00:27:32,959
I don't want to point a gun at you.

515
00:27:33,319 --> 00:27:33,719
Zhao Shengge...

516
00:27:33,799 --> 00:27:34,960
You're hurting me.

517
00:27:35,519 --> 00:27:36,719
Don't try to play cute.

518
00:27:36,799 --> 00:27:37,799
Just do as I say.

519
00:27:44,079 --> 00:27:45,479
Chen Wan.

520
00:27:45,559 --> 00:27:47,255
No matter what you hear
later, do not come out.

521
00:27:47,279 --> 00:27:48,856
I'm not their target. They
won't do anything to me.

522
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:49,880
Let go of me!

523
00:27:50,519 --> 00:27:52,519
Once you're out, find a
place to hide immediately.

524
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:54,920
Don't make me worry.

525
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:56,240
I won't say it again.

526
00:27:56,799 --> 00:27:57,800
Once the alarm sounds,

527
00:27:57,880 --> 00:27:59,416
initiate the detachment
sequence immediately.

528
00:27:59,440 --> 00:28:01,400
I'll help release the pod from the outside.

529
00:28:01,480 --> 00:28:01,920
If the time comes

530
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:04,320
and I see you haven't
initiated the sequence,

531
00:28:04,400 --> 00:28:05,696
I'll trigger the main
vessel's emergency brakes

532
00:28:05,720 --> 00:28:06,976
until it forces the pod to detach.

533
00:28:07,000 --> 00:28:08,239
What do you mean?

534
00:28:08,319 --> 00:28:09,239
Are you using the whole ship

535
00:28:09,319 --> 00:28:10,720
and your own life to threaten me?

536
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:12,600
Take these bullets.

537
00:28:12,680 --> 00:28:13,279
What are you doing?

538
00:28:13,359 --> 00:28:14,039
I still have some.

539
00:28:14,119 --> 00:28:15,200
Keep them, just in case.

540
00:28:19,279 --> 00:28:19,840
Hey!

541
00:28:19,920 --> 00:28:20,920
Come out!

542
00:28:22,799 --> 00:28:24,680
Search the whole place thoroughly!

543
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,120
We're out of time.

544
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:27,959
We'll buy you an hour.

545
00:28:28,039 --> 00:28:28,880
See you on land after that.

546
00:28:28,960 --> 00:28:29,960
Chen Wan.

547
00:28:30,519 --> 00:28:31,896
If you dare take one step out of there,

548
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:33,519
we are done for good.

549
00:28:33,599 --> 00:28:34,720
Please enter the passcode.

550
00:28:36,279 --> 00:28:37,439
You...

551
00:28:37,519 --> 00:28:38,679
have no integrity,

552
00:28:38,759 --> 00:28:39,560
disobey orders,

553
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:40,800
and refuse to follow my lead.

554
00:28:40,839 --> 00:28:42,599
Minglong can't afford
a contractor like you.

555
00:28:43,920 --> 00:28:45,080
Chen Wan.

556
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:46,839
I, Zhao Shengge, always keep my word.

557
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:54,039
I can cut you out of my life,

558
00:28:54,119 --> 00:28:56,400
as long as I know you're safe.

559
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:57,800
Get this straight.

560
00:28:57,880 --> 00:29:00,160
Since when do you get
to call the shots in my life?

561
00:29:01,160 --> 00:29:03,039
Cabin temperature set.

562
00:29:03,119 --> 00:29:04,119
What gives you the right?

563
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:06,360
Who are you to me?

564
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:08,320
Don't you think you're
overestimating yourself?

565
00:29:08,359 --> 00:29:10,439
Cabin humidity set.

566
00:29:10,519 --> 00:29:11,759
Stop being a burden.

567
00:29:11,839 --> 00:29:13,800
I won't thank you for this.

568
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:15,520
I'll only blame you for ruining my plans.

569
00:29:16,039 --> 00:29:17,679
Don't do this, okay?

570
00:29:17,759 --> 00:29:19,519
Don't make me hate you.

571
00:29:19,599 --> 00:29:20,400
Settings complete.

572
00:29:20,480 --> 00:29:22,040
It doesn't have to be like this, right?

573
00:29:24,359 --> 00:29:25,800
I've set the cabin temperature.

574
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:27,239
I punched in a random passcode.

575
00:29:27,319 --> 00:29:29,239
Don't bother trying
to guess it after I leave.

576
00:29:29,319 --> 00:29:30,416
Even I don't know what it is.

577
00:29:30,440 --> 00:29:31,719
Once you reach a safe zone,

578
00:29:31,799 --> 00:29:32,519
the hatch will open automatically.

579
00:29:32,599 --> 00:29:33,479
Chen Wan!

580
00:29:33,559 --> 00:29:34,680
Goodbye, Zhao Shengge.

581
00:29:35,759 --> 00:29:37,319
Did you not understand a word I said?!

582
00:29:38,759 --> 00:29:39,759
Chen Wan!

583
00:29:41,519 --> 00:29:42,519
Chen Wan!

584
00:29:46,559 --> 00:29:47,559
Chen Wan!

585
00:29:54,279 --> 00:29:55,279
Chen Wan!

586
00:30:01,039 --> 00:30:02,160
Zhao Shengge...

587
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:03,240
Goodbye.

588
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:18,479
Now I know.

589
00:30:18,559 --> 00:30:19,600
Chen Wan cares about me

590
00:30:19,680 --> 00:30:21,679
far more than I ever imagined.

591
00:30:21,759 --> 00:30:23,136
It's not out of politeness or manners.

592
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:25,360
It's not just his innate gentleness,

593
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:27,719
nor is it the worldly tact
he learned the hard way.

594
00:30:27,799 --> 00:30:30,239
And it's certainly not out
of fear or apprehension.

595
00:30:30,319 --> 00:30:31,479
None of that.

596
00:30:31,559 --> 00:30:32,680
It's Chen Wan's heart.

597
00:30:33,640 --> 00:30:35,439
His devotion to me alone.

598
00:30:35,519 --> 00:30:36,519
Chen Wan!

599
00:30:37,039 --> 00:30:38,039
Chen Wan!

600
00:30:43,319 --> 00:30:44,640
Chen Wan.

601
00:30:46,279 --> 00:30:47,680
Chen Wan.

602
00:30:53,480 --> 00:30:55,320
Mr. Chen, I see you!

603
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:56,400
Come on out!

604
00:30:57,759 --> 00:30:59,279
You're not the one we want!

605
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:02,959
If you cooperate with us,

606
00:31:03,039 --> 00:31:04,480
we'll make it worth your while!

607
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:09,000
Over there! Split up and go after him!

608
00:31:28,359 --> 00:31:29,359
Split up and search!

609
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:42,720
After him!

610
00:32:07,240 --> 00:32:08,240
Zhao Shengge.

611
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,640
Zhao Shengge!

612
00:32:37,119 --> 00:32:38,119
I'm fine.
